      Data: Henry18
    - Name: <Text>k__BackingField
      Entry: 1
      Data: Oh, and if you find more <style=item>carrots</style> along your travels,
        I'd happily buy them from you. I do love <style=item>carrots</style> after
        all. Let's say, 3 <style=coin>coins</style> for every 5 <style=item>carrots</style>.
        Hope to see you soon!
